# Shear stresses due to bending

This is treated in Chapter 5.1 and 5.2 (Longitudinal shear stresses), and 5.3 and 5.4 (Cross-sectional shear stresses) of the book Engineering Mechanics Volume 2 {cite:p}`Hartsuijker2007`.

